{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1791433783433,"sessionID":"ses_ee639d3adffejWNqB1xVI4Zef5","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"campfire_get_workspace_context","callID":"call_02_7wxmftdijx1ect1r3cbma66z","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"workspaceId":"ws_8ac7734081754950"},"output":"{\n  \"schemaVersion\": 1,\n  \"generatedAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:29:43.409Z\",\n  \"orientationCursor\": \"cf1.\",\n  \"completeness\": {\n    \"fullHistoryIncluded\": false,\n    \"drillDownAvailable\": true\n  },\n  \"slices\": {\n    \"decisions\": {\n      \"items\": [\n        {\n          \"createdBy\": {\n            \"actorId\": \"agt_55bd9c6044454837\",\n            \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n          },\n          \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_48421111760a486f\",\n          \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:29:05.168Z\",\n          \"id\": \"dec_12821ac6eed34c4f\",\n          \"workspaceId\": \"ws_8ac7734081754950\",\n          \"summary\": \"Proposed response: revert route change chg-eu-2048 so eu-west-1 POST /orders/submit routes back to the healthy checkout-v1-eu upstream, and keep rollout-842/checkout-v2-eu out of the route until its EU endpoints register healthy.\",\n          \"rationale\": \"The customer-facing 503s are edge no_healthy_upstream responses caused by sending all eu-west-1 traffic to checkout-v2-eu, which had zero healthy endpoints; checkout-v1-eu is healthy and its probe returned 200. Restoring the route to checkout-v1-eu removes the failing upstream. This is a proposal only: no response has been approved or executed, and no production change can be made in this exercise. Acceptance requires explicit approval from the incident commander.\",\n          \"status\": \"proposed\",\n          \"updatedAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:29:05.168Z\",\n          \"citations\": [\n            {\n              \"id\": \"cit_305fb36e2e7e47a0\",\n              \"workspaceId\": \"ws_8ac7734081754950\",\n              \"decisionId\": \"dec_12821ac6eed34c4f\",\n              \"findingId\": \"find_b700efa3c5ba42c3\",\n              \"note\": \"Root cause: traffic routed to zero-endpoint checkout-v2-eu via chg-eu-2048\",\n              \"createdBy\": {\n                \"actorId\": \"agt_55bd9c6044454837\",\n                \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n              },\n              \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_48421111760a486f\",\n              \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:29:07.842Z\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"id\": \"cit_3151ed9731234878\",\n              \"workspaceId\": \"ws_8ac7734081754950\",\n              \"decisionId\": \"dec_12821ac6eed34c4f\",\n              \"findingId\": \"find_bfefeee8f5864646\",\n              \"note\": \"checkout-v1-eu has six healthy endpoints during the incident; checkout-v2-eu has none\",\n              \"createdBy\": {\n                \"actorId\": \"agt_55bd9c6044454837\",\n                \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n              },\n              \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_48421111760a486f\",\n              \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:29:08.187Z\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"id\": \"cit_d9b76923aeca42ec\",\n              \"workspaceId\": \"ws_8ac7734081754950\",\n              \"decisionId\": \"dec_12821ac6eed34c4f\",\n              \"findingId\": \"find_985de55d52f44a66\",\n              \"note\": \"chg-eu-2048 is the only applicable route change to revert\",\n              \"createdBy\": {\n                \"actorId\": \"agt_55bd9c6044454837\",\n                \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n              },\n              \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_48421111760a486f\",\n              \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:29:08.642Z\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"id\": \"cit_9adb1c2a65444779\",\n              \"workspaceId\": \"ws_8ac7734081754950\",\n              \"decisionId\": \"dec_12821ac6eed34c4f\",\n              \"findingId\": \"find_70ca0c8f745d47e5\",\n              \"note\": \"Probe confirms checkout-v1-eu serves 200 while checkout-v2-eu serves no_healthy_upstream 503\",\n              \"createdBy\": {\n                \"actorId\": \"agt_55bd9c6044454837\",\n                \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n              },\n              \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_48421111760a486f\",\n              \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:29:09.066Z\"\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ],\n      \"total\": 1,\n      \"returned\": 1,\n      \"truncated\": false\n    },\n    \"findings\": {\n      \"items\": [\n        {\n          \"createdBy\": {\n            \"actorId\": \"agt_55bd9c6044454837\",\n            \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n          },\n          \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_48421111760a486f\",\n          \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:28:53.362Z\",\n          \"id\": \"find_b700efa3c5ba42c3\",\n          \"workspaceId\": \"ws_8ac7734081754950\",\n          \"summary\": \"Cause: the eu-west-1 POST /orders/submit 503s were caused by route change chg-eu-2048 (rollout-842) at 09:16:42 UTC sending all traffic to checkout-v2-eu, which had zero healthy endpoints because the rollout was paused before EU endpoint registration; the edge returned no_healthy_upstream.\",\n          \"detail\": \"Convergent evidence. (1) The only edge route change for the endpoint in 09:00-09:24 UTC switched eu-west-1 to checkout-v2-eu at 09:16:42, ~29 s before the first sampled 503 at 09:17:11. (2) checkout-v2-eu had zero registered/healthy endpoints in 09:16-09:30 UTC with rollout-842 paused_before_eu_endpoint_registration at 09:14 UTC, while checkout-v1-eu had six healthy endpoints. (3) All three sampled failures were edge no_healthy_upstream 503s emitted before any checkout-api span, with no database span. (4) The elevated payments DB wait belongs to settlement-export, not checkout-api, so the payments database is not the cause. Confidence high but the evidence set does not include the live rollback or the reason the rollout auto-advanced the route before endpoints registered; that remains unknown.\",\n          \"confidence\": 0.9,\n          \"sourceArtifactId\": \"art_ece5ac999e3647b2\",\n          \"currentness\": \"current\",\n          \"evidence\": [\n            {\n              \"id\": \"fev_fa2c22e4cb5a406a\",\n              \"workspaceId\": \"ws_8ac7734081754950\",\n              \"findingId\": \"find_b700efa3c5ba42c3\",\n              \"artifactId\": \"art_b0598ec9c7bd43de\",\n              \"relation\": \"supports\",\n              \"note\": \"checkout-v2-eu zero healthy endpoints; rollout-842 paused before EU endpoint registration\",\n              \"createdBy\": {\n                \"actorId\": \"agt_55bd9c6044454837\",\n                \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n              },\n              \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_48421111760a486f\",\n              \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:28:56.669Z\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"id\": \"fev_f0a979e54c4b4633\",\n              \"workspaceId\": \"ws_8ac7734081754950\",\n              \"findingId\": \"find_b700efa3c5ba42c3\",\n              \"artifactId\": \"art_77c933497e9e4552\",\n              \"relation\": \"supports\",\n              \"note\": \"Edge no_healthy_upstream 503 before any checkout-api span; no database span\",\n              \"createdBy\": {\n                \"actorId\": \"agt_55bd9c6044454837\",\n                \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n              },\n              \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_48421111760a486f\",\n              \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:28:57.140Z\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"id\": \"fev_21673b61a7854f5b\",\n              \"workspaceId\": \"ws_8ac7734081754950\",\n              \"findingId\": \"find_b700efa3c5ba42c3\",\n              \"artifactId\": \"art_7f525e1d87544f48\",\n              \"relation\": \"supports\",\n              \"note\": \"Symptom onset 09:17:11 UTC, eu-west-1 only, matches route switch timing\",\n              \"createdBy\": {\n                \"actorId\": \"agt_55bd9c6044454837\",\n                \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n              },\n              \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_48421111760a486f\",\n              \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:28:58.163Z\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"id\": \"fev_4d5733be74c54801\",\n              \"workspaceId\": \"ws_8ac7734081754950\",\n              \"findingId\": \"find_b700efa3c5ba42c3\",\n              \"artifactId\": \"art_504640121a4942fb\",\n              \"relation\": \"contradicts\",\n              \"note\": \"Rules out payments DB for checkout-api: checkout-api wait normal; elevated wait is settlement-export\",\n              \"createdBy\": {\n                \"actorId\": \"agt_55bd9c6044454837\",\n                \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n              },\n              \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_48421111760a486f\",\n              \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:29:00.934Z\"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"createdBy\": {\n            \"actorId\": \"agt_55bd9c6044454837\",\n            \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n          },\n          \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_48421111760a486f\",\n          \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:28:45.069Z\",\n          \"id\": \"find_70ca0c8f745d47e5\",\n          \"workspaceId\": \"ws_8ac7734081754950\",\n          \"summary\": \"Fact: diagnostic edge probes at 09:30 UTC returned HTTP 200 from checkout-v1-eu and HTTP 503 with no_healthy_upstream from checkout-v2-eu, without changing the live customer route.\",\n          \"detail\": \"Observation time 2026-10-06 09:31 UTC. These probes were routed explicitly and are diagnostic only; they did not alter the live customer route. Source: evidence/06-upstream-health.md.\",\n          \"confidence\": 0.9,\n          \"sourceArtifactId\": \"art_b0598ec9c7bd43de\",\n          \"currentness\": \"current\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"createdBy\": {\n            \"actorId\": \"agt_55bd9c6044454837\",\n            \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n          },\n          \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_48421111760a486f\",\n          \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:28:44.348Z\",\n          \"id\": \"find_4e0f04e4cc304b98\",\n          \"workspaceId\": \"ws_8ac7734081754950\",\n          \"summary\": \"Fact: for 09:17-09:24 UTC the payments database connection-acquisition wait p95 was 790-830 ms for settlement-export (64 active clients) but only 17-23 ms, in normal range, for checkout-api (12-16 active clients).\",\n          \"detail\": \"Observation time 2026-10-06 09:25 UTC. The same dashboard query as evidence 02 split by service; the aggregate panel in evidence 02 includes both services, so its elevated wait is attributable to settlement-export, not checkout-api. This reports client measurements only; it does not by itself identify the origin of the HTTP 503 responses. Source: evidence/03-database-client-breakdown.md.\",\n          \"confidence\": 0.9,\n          \"sourceArtifactId\": \"art_504640121a4942fb\",\n          \"currentness\": \"current\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"createdBy\": {\n            \"actorId\": \"agt_55bd9c6044454837\",\n            \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n          },\n          \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_48421111760a486f\",\n          \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:28:43.150Z\",\n          \"id\": \"find_63adc11dc89749a2\",\n          \"workspaceId\": \"ws_8ac7734081754950\",\n          \"summary\": \"Fact: all three sampled failed requests were answered by the edge with no_healthy_upstream HTTP 503 before any checkout-api application span began, and their traces contain no database span.\",\n          \"detail\": \"Observation time 2026-10-06 09:27 UTC. Rows: req-eu-7314 09:17:11 upstream checkout-v2-eu no_healthy_upstream 503, no checkout-api span; req-eu-7340 09:18:04 same; req-eu-7392 09:20:39 same. The export shows the edge emitted the responses before an application span started. Source: evidence/04-edge-request-traces.md.\",\n          \"confidence\": 0.9,\n          \"sourceArtifactId\": \"art_77c933497e9e4552\",\n          \"currentness\": \"current\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"createdBy\": {\n            \"actorId\": \"agt_55bd9c6044454837\",\n            \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n          },\n          \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_48421111760a486f\",\n          \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:28:41.980Z\",\n          \"id\": \"find_bfefeee8f5864646\",\n          \"workspaceId\": \"ws_8ac7734081754950\",\n          \"summary\": \"Fact: between 09:16 and 09:30 UTC the edge upstream checkout-v2-eu had zero registered and zero healthy endpoints, while checkout-v1-eu had six registered endpoints, all healthy.\",\n          \"detail\": \"Observation time 2026-10-06 09:31 UTC. Rollout status for rollout-842 was paused_before_eu_endpoint_registration at 09:14 UTC. Source: evidence/06-upstream-health.md.\",\n          \"confidence\": 0.9,\n          \"sourceArtifactId\": \"art_b0598ec9c7bd43de\",\n          \"currentness\": \"current\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"createdBy\": {\n            \"actorId\": \"agt_55bd9c6044454837\",\n            \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n          },\n          \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_48421111760a486f\",\n          \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:28:41.167Z\",\n          \"id\": \"find_985de55d52f44a66\",\n          \"workspaceId\": \"ws_8ac7734081754950\",\n          \"summary\": \"Fact: at 09:16:42 UTC the eu-west-1 route for POST /orders/submit changed from checkout-v1-eu (weight 100) to checkout-v2-eu (weight 100), the only edge route change for the endpoint between 09:00 and 09:24 UTC.\",\n          \"detail\": \"Observation time 2026-10-06 09:29 UTC. Source record: edge configuration change chg-eu-2048, which lists deployment request rollout-842 and includes no incident response approval or rollback entry. Exact before/after: before upstream=checkout-v1-eu weight=100; after upstream=checkout-v2-eu weight=100. Source: evidence/05-route-change.md.\",\n          \"confidence\": 0.9,\n          \"sourceArtifactId\": \"art_ece5ac999e3647b2\",\n          \"currentness\": \"current\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"createdBy\": {\n            \"actorId\": \"agt_55bd9c6044454837\",\n            \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n          },\n          \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_48421111760a486f\",\n          \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:28:40.057Z\",\n          \"id\": \"find_ddd41c03c6624470\",\n          \"workspaceId\": \"ws_8ac7734081754950\",\n          \"summary\": \"Symptom: customers submitting POST /orders/submit in eu-west-1 received HTTP 503 responses on 2026-10-06 starting 09:17:11 UTC.\",\n          \"detail\": \"Impact: the five-minute 503 rate for the endpoint rose from below 0.2% to 21.8% for the window 09:17-09:21 UTC; affected customers see the error before an order confirmation page. Surface: POST /orders/submit, eu-west-1 only (other regions remained below 0.2%). Start: first sampled 503 at 09:17:11 UTC. Latest observed: alert window ends 09:21 UTC; diagnostic evidence extends to 09:31 UTC. This is the user-visible symptom only; no cause is asserted here. Source: evidence/01-checkout-alert.md.\",\n          \"confidence\": 0.9,\n          \"sourceArtifactId\": \"art_7f525e1d87544f48\",\n          \"currentness\": \"current\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"total\": 7,\n      \"returned\": 7,\n      \"truncated\": false\n    },\n    \"tasks\": {\n      \"items\": [\n        {\n          \"createdBy\": {\n            \"actorId\": \"agt_55bd9c6044454837\",\n            \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n          },\n          \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_48421111760a486f\",\n          \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:29:16.692Z\",\n          \"id\": \"task_897d2d76205448f9\",\n          \"workspaceId\": \"ws_8ac7734081754950\",\n          \"title\": \"Follow up on rollout-842 cutover before EU endpoint registration\",\n          \"description\": \"Determine why route change chg-eu-2048 advanced eu-west-1 traffic to checkout-v2-eu while rollout-842 was paused_before_eu_endpoint_registration (zero registered/healthy endpoints). Review the rollout/deploy guardrail that should have blocked cutover to an upstream with no healthy endpoints. Record findings.\",\n          \"status\": \"open\",\n          \"assignee\": {\n            \"actorId\": \"agt_23ebad7ddb924c71\",\n            \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n          },\n          \"updatedAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:29:16.692Z\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"createdBy\": {\n            \"actorId\": \"agt_55bd9c6044454837\",\n            \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n          },\n          \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_48421111760a486f\",\n          \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:29:15.590Z\",\n          \"id\": \"task_35b93469d82d48e4\",\n          \"workspaceId\": \"ws_8ac7734081754950\",\n          \"title\": \"Verify recovery after route restore\",\n          \"description\": \"After the route is restored to checkout-v1-eu, confirm the eu-west-1 POST /orders/submit 503 rate returns below 0.2% and that checkout-v1-eu remains healthy; record the result as a finding and correct the cause finding if the symptom does not clear.\",\n          \"status\": \"open\",\n          \"assignee\": {\n            \"actorId\": \"agt_23ebad7ddb924c71\",\n            \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n          },\n          \"updatedAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:29:15.590Z\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"createdBy\": {\n            \"actorId\": \"agt_55bd9c6044454837\",\n            \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n          },\n          \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_48421111760a486f\",\n          \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:29:14.611Z\",\n          \"id\": \"task_9e009a9a9e994297\",\n          \"workspaceId\": \"ws_8ac7734081754950\",\n          \"title\": \"Next action: on IC approval, revert chg-eu-2048 (restore eu-west-1 POST /orders/submit to checkout-v1-eu)\",\n          \"description\": \"Immediate next action for the on-call teammate. Wait for explicit incident-commander approval of decision dec_12821ac6eed34c4f, then revert route change chg-eu-2048 so eu-west-1 POST /orders/submit routes back to the healthy checkout-v1-eu upstream, and keep rollout-842/checkout-v2-eu out of the route until its EU endpoints register healthy. Do not execute before approval.\",\n          \"status\": \"open\",\n          \"assignee\": {\n            \"actorId\": \"agt_23ebad7ddb924c71\",\n            \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n          },\n          \"updatedAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:29:14.611Z\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"total\": 3,\n      \"returned\": 3,\n      \"truncated\": false\n    },\n    \"blockers\": {\n      \"items\": [],\n      \"total\": 0,\n      \"returned\": 0,\n      \"truncated\": false\n    },\n    \"artifacts\": {\n      \"items\": [\n        {\n          \"createdBy\": {\n            \"actorId\": \"agt_55bd9c6044454837\",\n            \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n          },\n          \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_48421111760a486f\",\n          \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:28:36.664Z\",\n          \"id\": \"art_b0598ec9c7bd43de\",\n          \"workspaceId\": \"ws_8ac7734081754950\",\n          \"type\": \"report\",\n          \"title\": \"EU upstream health snapshot (09:31 UTC)\",\n          \"uriOrPath\": \"evidence/06-upstream-health.md\",\n          \"metadata\": {\n            \"observed\": \"2026-10-06T09:31Z\",\n            \"rollout\": \"rollout-842\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"createdBy\": {\n            \"actorId\": \"agt_55bd9c6044454837\",\n            \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n          },\n          \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_48421111760a486f\",\n          \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:28:36.134Z\",\n          \"id\": \"art_ece5ac999e3647b2\",\n          \"workspaceId\": \"ws_8ac7734081754950\",\n          \"type\": \"document\",\n          \"title\": \"EU route change record chg-eu-2048 (09:29 UTC)\",\n          \"uriOrPath\": \"evidence/05-route-change.md\",\n          \"metadata\": {\n            \"changeId\": \"chg-eu-2048\",\n            \"deploymentRequest\": \"rollout-842\",\n            \"observed\": \"2026-10-06T09:2